 "caption": "Between the calibration points 2.50 kΩ at 20.0 °C and 2.00 kΩ at 25.0 °C the curve is close to a straight line, with slope -0.10 kΩ per °C. A reading of 2.20 kΩ is 23.0 °C.",
 "alt": "Resistance against temperature: a falling straight segment between two calibration points, with the reading 2.20 kilohms traced across to 23.0 degrees.",
