  "Calibration points: (20.0 °C, 2.50 kΩ) and (25.0 °C, 2.00 kΩ).",
  "Slope = (2.00 − 2.50) / (25 − 20) = -0.10 kΩ per °C.",
  "Reading 2.20 kΩ: T = 20.0 + (2.50 − 2.20) / 0.10 = 23.0 °C.",
  "Over a wider range a thermistor is far from linear: ln R against 1/T is the curve to fit."
